### jaehoon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### 나는 누구
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/me

### 9번 게시물 받기
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/9

### 9번 게시물의 글 고치기
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "jaehoon이 고친 글"
}

### 9번 게시물 지우기
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/9
